ield-officer-39","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#ask-before-you-write","content":"**Where exactly.** A village or facility name, not just a district. This is\nwhat decides who receives it."},"352":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-40","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#ask-before-you-write","content":"**When exactly.** A date, even an approximate one."},"353":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-41","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#ask-before-you-write","content":"**What specifically went wrong**, in the person's own words rather than a\nsummary like \"service problem\"."},"354":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-42","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#ask-before-you-write","content":"**Whether they want to be contacted.** If they do, take a phone number. If\nthey would rather not be named, that is their right — record it anonymously\nand say so."},"355":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-43","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"**Ibibazo Bifunguye** (*Open Issues*) in the sidebar lists complaints that are\nstill active."},"356":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-44","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"The coloured pill in the **Imimerere** (*Status*) column shows where each one\nhas got to:"},"357":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-45","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"Pill"},"358":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-46","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"English"},"359":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-47","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"Meaning"},"360":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-48","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"Gishya"},"361":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-49","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"New"},"362":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-50","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"Recorded, not yet reviewed"},"363":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-51","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"Birakorwa"},"364":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-52","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"In Progress"},"365":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-53","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"Assigned, being worked on"},"366":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-54","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"Byakemuwe"},"367":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-55","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-have-recorded","content":"Resolved"},"368":{"id":"/docs/staff/field-officer-56","page_id":"/docs/staff/field-officer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/field-officer#checking-on-what-you-h