t","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Citizen Information"},"407":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-33","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Contact details, if any were given"},"408":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-34","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Inyandiko z'ibikorwa by'ikibazo"},"409":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-35","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Issue Activity Log"},"410":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-36","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Every action taken, in order"},"411":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-37","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Gukurikirana Ibibazo"},"412":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-38","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Issue Tracking"},"413":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-39","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Progress against the complaint"},"414":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-40","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Iyinjizwa"},"415":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-41","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Escalation"},"416":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-42","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"Escalation history, if it was escalated"},"417":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-43","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#open-a-complaint","content":"**Citizen Information may be empty, and that is deliberate.** People are\nallowed to report anonymously. An empty contact tab is not a data problem and\nis not something to chase — it means nobody may be called about this\ncomplaint, and the outcome has to be published through the tracking code\ninstead."},"418":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-44","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#assign-it-to-someone","content":"Use **Assign** in the right-hand panel to add an officer, or **Reassign\nIssue** at the top of the page to move it to a different one."},"419":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-45","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#assign-it-to-someone","content":"Before you assign, check two things:"},"420":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-46","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#assign-it-to-someone","content":"**Is the region right?** Routing follows the region on the complaint. If it\nis wrong, the complaint sits with an office that cannot act on it."},"421":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-47","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#assign-it-to-someone","content":"**Is the category right?** A \"Question\" misfiled as a \"Complaint\" enters a\nresolution process it never needed."},"422":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-48","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#assign-it-to-someone","content":"Both are quicker to correct now than after the work has been handed on."},"423":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-49","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#record-the-outcome","content":"When the assigned officer has finished, the outcome is recorded against the\ncomplaint and the status moves on."},"424":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-50","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#record-the-outcome","content":"After you record a resolution, **re-open the complaint and check the status\nfield reads what you expect**. The status the public sees on the tracking page\nis this field — if it has not moved, the person checking their tracking code\nwill still be told the complaint is open."},"425":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-51","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#record-the-outcome","content":"Write the outcome so that it makes sense to someone who was not involved: what\nwas found, what was done, and when. This text is the record of the decision."},"426":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-52","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#escalations-and-appeals","content":"Two cards on the main screen cover work that did not finish normally:"},"427":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-53","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#escalations-and-appeals","content":"**Igenzura → Ibyitwajwe** (*Supervision → Escalated*) — complaints raised to\na higher level, usually because they passed their time limit or needed\nauthority the assigned officer did not have."},"428":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-54","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#escalations-and-appeals","content":"**Igitekerezo → Ubujurire** (*Feedback → Appeals*) — where someone has come\nback dissatisfied with the outcome."},"429":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-55","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#escalations-and-appeals","content":"Check both regularly. Neither will come to you as a notification if you are\nnot assigned to the individual complaint."},"430":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-56","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#what-you-can-and-cannot-see","content":"You see complaints for the regions you are assigned to, **including the\nregions beneath them**. A supervisor assigned at province level sees the\ndistricts within it; an officer assigned to one district sees only that one."},"431":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-57","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#what-you-can-and-cannot-see","content":"If a complaint you expect is missing, the usual cause is a region assignment,\nnot a permission setting — check with your administrator."},"432":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-58","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**A complaint is in the wrong region.** Correct the region, then reassign.\nChanging the assignee alone leaves the routing wrong for next time."},"433":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-59","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**Nobody is available in the assigned department.** Reassign to another\nofficer rather than leaving it unassigned — an unassigned complaint has no\nowner and will not be picked up by anyone."},"434":{"id":"/docs/staff/reviewer-60","page_id":"/docs/staff/reviewer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/reviewer#if-you-get-stuck","content":"**The same problem is reported twice.** Resolve one and record the other's\ntracking code in the outcome, so both codes give the person a real answer."},"435":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","type":"page","content":"Signing in","breadcrumbs":["Docs","For staff","For staff"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/signing-in"},"436":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-0","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in","content":"How to reach your work area, and what the main screen is showing you."},"437":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-1","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#sign-in","content":"Sign in"},"438":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-2","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"The main screen"},"439":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-3","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#which-role-am-i","content":"Which role am I?"},"440":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-4","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#if-you-get-stuck","content":"If you get stuck"},"441":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-5","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in","content":"Staff work in a different part of the system from the public website. You need\nan account, which an administrator creates for you."},"442":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-6","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#sign-in","content":"Go to **egrm.risa.gov.rw/login** and enter\nthe email address and password you were given."},"443":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-7","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#sign-in","content":"After signing in you land on the **eGRM** work area."},"444":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-8","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Two parts matter:"},"445":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-9","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"**The sidebar on the left** is always there. Its entries are:"},"446":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-10","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Kinyarwanda"},"447":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-11","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"English"},"448":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-12","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Shakisha"},"449":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-13","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Search"},"450":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-14","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Imenyekanisha"},"451":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-15","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Notifications"},"452":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-16","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Ahabanza"},"453":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-17","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Home"},"454":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-18","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Andika Ikibazo"},"455":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-19","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Record Issue"},"456":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-20","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Ibibazo Bifunguye"},"457":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-21","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Open Issues"},"458":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-22","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Iby'integuro Byanjye"},"459":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-23","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"My Assignments"},"460":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-24","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"**The cards in the middle** group everything else by the kind of work it\nbelongs to — intake, feedback, supervision, projects, users, and system\nsettings. You will only be able to open the ones your role allows."},"461":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-25","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"Your name and email are shown at the bottom-left. Click there to sign out."},"462":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-26","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#the-main-screen","content":"The staff screens display in **Kinyarwanda**, because that is the language\nthis system is set to. The Screen labels page lists every\nlabel you will meet with its English meaning. If you would rather work in\nEnglish, ask your administrator to set the language on your own account — it\nchanges only what you see, not what anyone else sees."},"463":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-27","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#which-role-am-i","content":"Roles in eGRM are about **duties**, and most staff hold several at once. What\nactually differs between two officers is usually the **region** they are\nassigned to, not the buttons they can press."},"464":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-28","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#which-role-am-i","content":"If your job is…"},"465":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-29","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#which-role-am-i","content":"Read"},"466":{"id":"/docs/staff/signing-in-30","page_id":"/docs/staff/signing-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/staff/signing-in#which-role-am-i","content":"Taking c